{"id":100051,"date":"2022-08-15T18:51:12","date_gmt":"2022-08-15T11:51:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/?p=100051"},"modified":"2022-08-15T18:51:12","modified_gmt":"2022-08-15T11:51:12","slug":"bupati-jember-lantik-tiga-direksi-perumdam-tirta-pandalungan","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/bupati-jember-lantik-tiga-direksi-perumdam-tirta-pandalungan\/","title":{"rendered":"Bupati Jember Lantik Tiga Direksi Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-100057 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/humas.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1873-scaled-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" \/><\/p>\n<p>JEMBER, Bupati Jember Ir. H. Hendy Siswanto, ST. IPU melantik 3 orang direksi Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan, Senin 15 Agustus 2022.<\/p>\n<p>Mereka yang dilantik di antaranya, Miftahur Ridho sebagai direktur utama, Bagus Andi Puspito sebagai direktur teknik dan Yudho Radityo Utomo sebagai direktur umum.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-100051 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1827-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1827-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1834-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1834-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1848-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1848-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1857-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1857-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1862-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1862-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1874-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1874-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Bupati Hendy menyampaikan, mereka bertiga telah melalui serangkaian seleksi dan dinyatakan lulus oleh Pansel Calon Direksi Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan.<\/p>\n<p>&#8220;Ke depan bukan semakin mudah, yang jelas saya berharap ada perkembangan pelanggan. Saat ini ada 43.000 pelanggan, saya ingin 100.000 pelanggan pada 2027,&#8221; ujar Bupati Hendy Siswanto.<\/p>\n<p>Ia menyampaikan, masih banyak yang belum tersentuh sambungan air di kota, terlebih daerah yang rawan kekeringan air bersih seperti salah satunya Kelurahan Gebang harus menjadi perhatian khusus pemimpin Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-100051 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1877-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1877-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1879-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1879-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1883-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1883-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1887-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/IMG_1887-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" 